  "story": {
    "text": "Out walking, Marianne sees a {RIDER} coming down the hill and runs to meet him: Willoughby! But it is Edward Ferrars, on a borrowed {HORSE}. All week he is {QUIET} and {GLOOMY}, and wears a ring with a lock of {HAIR} in it: his {SISTER}’s, he says, {COLOURING}. Elinor thinks it is her own, and is {SECRETLY} glad.",
